  "comments": "<p>This piece was engraved by severals contries and by severals engravers according to the following periods:<br>&nbsp;</p><ul><li>2002 Netherlands: caduceus - Mark : bow and star - W. J. van Schauwenburg (interim)<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2003 - 2004 Netherlands: caduceus - Mark : Sails - Maarten Brouwer (holder)<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2005 - 2006 Finland: \"S\" and logo of Vanda mint<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2007 - 2008 France: horn of plenty and \"F\" in star - Mark : hunting horn - Hubert Lariviere<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2009 - 2015 Nederland : caduceus - Mark : Sails - Maarten Brouwer (holder)<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2016 - 2017 Netherlands: caduceus - Mark : Sails and star - Kees Bruinsma (interim)<br>&nbsp;</li><li>2018 (In sets only) Netherlands: caduceus - Mark : Bridge - Stephan Satijn (holder)<br>&nbsp;</li></ul><p><br>Since 2018, Luxembourg using lion mark.<br>2018 (normal): caduceus and lion<br>2018 (Proof): Lion and bridge - Stephan Satijn (holder)</p>",
